# capture / peek / snapshot data artifacts dropped in the checkout for scp -- never needed in the image, and they
# bloat the build context (fly deploy uploads the whole dir). `*.gz`/`*.jsonl` match only ROOT-level files (Docker
# globs don't cross `/`), so nested research/*.gz is unaffected.
*.jsonl
*.gz
*.log
ourfeed*
capture*
peek*
snap*
